textSize small
title Guest Screen Flow - GoalZone Football Field Booking

legend [position: bottom-left] {
  [shape: rectangle, label: "Page / visible tab or panel"]
  [shape: oval, label: "Modal / notice / outcome"]
}

LandingPage [shape: rectangle, label: "Landing Page"]
FieldListScreen [shape: rectangle, label: "Field List"]
FieldDetailModal [shape: oval, label: "Field Detail Modal"]
BookingScreen [shape: rectangle, label: "Booking / Live Availability"]
PromotionListScreen [shape: rectangle, label: "Promotion List"]
MembershipBenefitsScreen [shape: rectangle, label: "Membership Benefits"]
LoginScreen [shape: rectangle, label: "Login"]
RegisterScreen [shape: rectangle, label: "Register Account"]
CustomerAccountScreen [shape: rectangle, label: "Customer Account"]
VerificationRequiredNotice [shape: oval, label: "Email Verification Required"]
VerifyEmailScreen [shape: rectangle, label: "Verify Email"]
VerifySuccessState [shape: oval, label: "Email Verified"]
VerifyFailedState [shape: oval, label: "Invalid / Expired Verification Link"]
LoginFailedNotice [shape: oval, label: "Login Failed"]
RegistrationFailedNotice [shape: oval, label: "Registration Failed"]
ForgotPasswordScreen [shape: rectangle, label: "Forgot Password"]
ResetLinkSentState [shape: oval, label: "Reset Link Sent"]
ResetPasswordScreen [shape: rectangle, label: "Set New Password"]
InvalidResetLinkState [shape: oval, label: "Invalid / Expired Reset Link"]
ResetSuccessState [shape: oval, label: "Password Reset Complete"]

LandingPage > FieldListScreen: Click "Fields" or "View fields"
FieldListScreen > FieldDetailModal: Select a field
FieldDetailModal > FieldListScreen: Close details
FieldDetailModal > BookingScreen: Click "Check availability"

LandingPage > BookingScreen: Click "Book a field" or "Show live slots"
BookingScreen > LoginScreen: Click "Sign in to book"

LandingPage > PromotionListScreen: Click "Offers"
PromotionListScreen > BookingScreen: Click "Use this code"

LandingPage > MembershipBenefitsScreen: Click "Membership"

LandingPage > LoginScreen: Click "Sign in"
LoginScreen > RegisterScreen: Select "Register" tab
RegisterScreen > CustomerAccountScreen: Submit valid registration and sign in automatically
RegisterScreen > RegistrationFailedNotice: Invalid or duplicate account information
RegistrationFailedNotice > RegisterScreen: Correct information and retry

CustomerAccountScreen > VerificationRequiredNotice: Account email is not verified
VerificationRequiredNotice > VerifyEmailScreen: Open verification link from email
VerifyEmailScreen > VerifySuccessState: Verification token is valid
VerifyEmailScreen > VerifyFailedState: Token is invalid or expired
VerifyFailedState > VerifyEmailScreen: Click "Resend email"
VerifySuccessState > BookingScreen: Continue booking while signed in
VerifySuccessState > LoginScreen: Back to login when no session exists

LoginScreen > CustomerAccountScreen: Submit valid Customer credentials
LoginScreen > LoginFailedNotice: Invalid credentials or locked account
LoginFailedNotice > LoginScreen: Correct credentials and retry

LoginScreen > ForgotPasswordScreen: Click "Forgot password?"
ForgotPasswordScreen > ResetLinkSentState: Submit a valid email
ResetLinkSentState > LoginScreen: Click "Back to login"
ResetLinkSentState > ResetPasswordScreen: Open reset link from email
ResetPasswordScreen > InvalidResetLinkState: Link is invalid or expired
InvalidResetLinkState > ForgotPasswordScreen: Request a new link
ResetPasswordScreen > ResetSuccessState: Submit a valid new password
ResetSuccessState > LoginScreen: Click "Go to login"
